# Canonical authorship for `git log`, `git shortlog` and any tool that reads it.
#
# pslr's history predates the move off GitHub (PSLR-thcaqtnw). 152 commits are
# authored to a GitHub noreply address belonging to an account that is now
# suspended, and 20 more to a former employer's address. Neither is reachable
# and neither is the address DESCRIPTION, CITATION.cff or codemeta.json name.
#
# This file corrects the reading of that history without rewriting it: the
# commits are published, so their SHAs stay exactly as they are.
